{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33064","headline":"送友人入塞 · 曹邺","name":"送友人入塞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乱蓬无根日，送子入青塞。\n苍茫万里秋，如见原野大。\n鸟雀寒不下，山川迥相对。\n一马没黄云，登高望犹在。\n惊风忽然起，白日黯已晦。\n如何怨路长，出门天涯外。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33064.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33064","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}